<div class="elvora-policy-page-wrapper">
  <!-- Subtle Header Banner -->
  <div class="elvora-policy-header">
    <div class="elvora-policy-badge">
      <span class="elvora-policy-dot"></span>
      <span>Official Store Policy • CS619 Compliant</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="elvora-policy-title">Shipping & Delivery Policy</h1>
    <p class="elvora-policy-subtitle">
      Comprehensive nationwide delivery terms, Cash on Delivery procedures, and clinical packaging standards for ELVORA Skincare customers across Pakistan.
    </p>
    <div class="elvora-policy-meta">
      <span>Last Updated: November 2026</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>Nationwide Express Logistics</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>250+ Cities Covered</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick Nav Tabs -->
  <div class="elvora-policy-tabs-nav">
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=shipping-policy" class="elvora-policy-tab is-active">Shipping Policy</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=privacy-policy" class="elvora-policy-tab">Privacy Policy</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=return-and-refund-policy" class="elvora-policy-tab">Return & Refund Policy</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=terms-and-conditions" class="elvora-policy-tab">Terms & Conditions</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=faq" class="elvora-policy-tab">FAQ</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact" class="elvora-policy-tab">Contact Us</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Content Card -->
  <div class="elvora-policy-content-card">
    
    <!-- Highlights Grid -->
    <div class="elvora-policy-highlights-grid">
      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Express Delivery</h4>
          <p>2 to 4 business days in major cities (Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi).</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Cash on Delivery (COD)</h4>
          <p>Available across Pakistan. Inspect outer packaging and pay in cash on arrival.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Free Shipping Over Rs. 2,500</h4>
          <p>Orders Rs. 2,500 and above qualify for 100% Free Shipping nationwide.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Clinical Climate Packaging</h4>
          <p>UV-blocking insulated containers protect active Vitamin C, Retinol & Niacinamide.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Article Sections -->
    <div class="elvora-policy-body">
      <h2>1. Nationwide Shipping Overview</h2>
      <p>
        ELVORA Skincare operates fulfillment nodes in <strong>Lahore, Karachi, and Islamabad</strong>, enabling rapid dispatch of our clinical skincare range to over 250 cities, towns, and districts throughout Pakistan. All orders are processed within <strong>24 business hours</strong> from our central temperature-controlled depot.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Shipping Rates & Thresholds</h2>
      <div class="elvora-policy-table-wrap">
        <table class="elvora-policy-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Order Value</th>
              <th>Destination</th>
              <th>Shipping Rate</th>
              <th>Estimated Time</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Rs. 2,500 & Above</strong></td>
              <td>All Cities in Pakistan</td>
              <td><span class="elvora-badge-free">FREE SHIPPING</span></td>
              <td>2 - 4 Business Days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Under Rs. 2,500</td>
              <td>Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi</td>
              <td>Rs. 200 (Flat Rate)</td>
              <td>2 - 3 Business Days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Under Rs. 2,500</td>
              <td>Other Cities, Semi-Urban & Rural Pakistan</td>
              <td>Rs. 250 (Flat Rate)</td>
              <td>3 - 5 Business Days</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2>3. Delivery Timeline & Working Days</h2>
      <p>
        Deliveries are handled through our authorized courier partners including <strong>TCS, Trax Logistics, Call Courier, and Leopards Courier</strong>. Deliveries take place from <strong>Monday through Saturday</strong> between 9:00 AM and 6:00 PM. Orders placed on Sundays or gazetted public holidays are processed on the subsequent working morning.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Cash on Delivery (COD) Procedure & Verification</h2>
      <p>
        For orders with payment method selected as <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD)</strong>:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>First-time customers may receive an automated WhatsApp or SMS verification code / confirmation call from our order desk.</li>
        <li>Please keep the exact cash amount ready at the time of delivery to avoid courier delays.</li>
        <li>Couriers are instructed to deliver parcels against receipt of payment. Once paid, the customer is entitled to immediate physical possession and an official digital delivery receipt.</li>
        <li>In case you are unavailable at your delivery address, our courier will make up to two (2) additional re-delivery attempts before returning the parcel to our hub.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Live Shipment Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        Once your clinical skincare order is handed over to the courier partner, an automated tracking number will be transmitted to you via SMS and Email. You can enter your Order ID anytime on our official <a href="/pages/contact?view=track-order" style="color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Track Your Order Portal</a> to monitor real-time shipment milestones.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Damaged or Leaked Bottles During Transit</h2>
      <p>
        Every ELVORA glass dropper bottle and pump is sealed with tamper-evident shrink bands and nestled in high-density shock-absorbing foam. In the rare event of transit damage or leakage:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Take a photograph or brief unboxing video showing the damaged bottle and shipping label.</li>
        <li>WhatsApp our Clinical Support desk within 48 hours at <strong>+92 300 1234567</strong> or email <strong>support@elvora.pk</strong>.</li>
        <li>We will issue an immediate, <strong>100% free replacement</strong> bottle without requiring complicated paperwork.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="elvora-policy-contact-box">
        <h4>Need Assistance with Your Delivery?</h4>
        <p>Our Pakistan customer support team is available Mon–Sat from 10:00 AM to 10:00 PM PKT.</p>
        <div class="elvora-policy-contact-actions">
          <a href="https://wa.me/923001234567" target="_blank" class="elvora-policy-btn-whatsapp">
            <span>WhatsApp: +92 300 1234567</span>
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:support@elvora.pk" class="elvora-policy-btn-email">
            <span>Email: support@elvora.pk</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

